<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

	<head>
		<meta charset="UTF-8" />

		<meta
			name="viewport"
			content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"
    />

		<meta
			name="description"
			content="Josh Maddox - Game Programmer and QA Engineer portfolio."
    />

		<title>Josh Maddox | Game Programmer & QA Engineer</title>

		<style>
			/* =====================================================
			BASIC
			===================================================== */
			* {
			box-sizing: border-box;
			margin: 0;
			padding: 0;
			}

			html {
			scroll-behavior: smooth;
			}

			body {
			min-height: 100vh;
			background: #000;
			color: #f2f2f2;
			font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
			line-height: 1.6;
			overflow-x: hidden;
			}

			a {
			color: inherit;
			text-decoration: none;
			}

			button {
			font: inherit;
			}

			ul {
			padding-left: 20px;
			}

			/* =====================================================
			MATRIX BACKGROUND
			===================================================== */
			#matrix-bg {
			position: fixed;
			top: 0;
			left: 0;
			width: 100vw;
			height: 100vh;
			pointer-events: none;
			z-index: 0;
			background: #000;
			}

			/* =====================================================
			KEEP WEBSITE ABOVE MATRIX
			===================================================== */
			header,
			main,
			footer {
			position: relative;
			z-index: 2;
			}

			/* =====================================================
			NAVIGATION
			===================================================== */
			header {
			position: sticky;
			top: 0;
			z-index: 100;
			background: rgba(8, 10, 13, 0.90);
			border-bottom: 1px solid #24282f;
			backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
			}

			nav {
			width: 90%;
			max-width: 1150px;
			min-height: 70px;
			margin: auto;
			display: flex;
			align-items: center;
			justify-content: space-between;
			}

			.logo {
			font-size: 20px;
			font-weight: bold;
			}

			.nav-links {
			display: flex;
			gap: 25px;
			}

			.nav-links a {
			color: #a8adb5;
			font-size: 14px;
			}

			.nav-links a:hover {
			color: white;
			}

			/* =====================================================
			MAIN
			===================================================== */
			main {
			width: 90%;
			max-width: 1150px;
			margin: auto;
			}

			/* =====================================================
			SHARED CONTENT BOX
			===================================================== */
			.content-box {
			background: rgba(18, 21, 26, 0.92);
			border: 1px solid #2b3038;
			border-radius: 8px;
			box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.25);
			}

			/* =====================================================
			HOME
			===================================================== */
			.hero {
			min-height: calc(100vh - 70px);
			display: flex;
			flex-direction: column;
			justify-content: center;
			padding: 50px 0;
			}

			.hero-content-box {
			width: 100%;
			max-width: 1100px;
			padding: 35px;
			}

			.hero-layout {
			display: grid;
			grid-template-columns: 1.45fr 0.8fr;
			gap: 30px;
			align-items: stretch;
			}

			.hero-left {
			display: flex;
			flex-direction: column;
			justify-content: center;
			}

			.hero-label {
			margin-bottom: 15px;
			color: #8d949e;
			font-size: 13px;
			font-weight: bold;
			letter-spacing: 4px;
			}

			.hero h1 {
			margin-bottom: 20px;
			font-size: clamp(60px, 9vw, 110px);
			line-height: 0.95;
			letter-spacing: -3px;
			}

			.hero h2 {
			margin-bottom: 25px;
			color: #b8bdc5;
			font-size: clamp(25px, 4vw, 35px);
			font-weight: normal;
			}

			.hero-description {
			max-width: 760px;
			color: #a6abb3;
			font-size: 18px;
			}

			.hero-buttons {
			display: flex;
			gap: 15px;
			margin-top: 35px;
			}

			.button {
			display: inline-block;
			padding: 12px 22px;
			border-radius: 5px;
			font-weight: bold;
			transition: transform 0.2s, background 0.2s;
			}

			.button:hover {
			transform: translateY(-2px);
			}

			.primary-button {
			background: white;
			color: #080a0d;
			}

			.primary-button:hover {
			background: #d8d8d8;
			}

			.secondary-button {
			background: rgba(21, 24, 29, 0.90);
			border: 1px solid #383d45;
			}

			.secondary-button:hover {
			background: #20242b;
			}

			.hero-image-box {
			min-height: 420px;
			background: rgba(14, 17, 22, 0.95);
			border: 1px solid #2f353e;
			border-radius: 8px;
			display: flex;
			align-items: center;
			justify-content: center;
			overflow: hidden;
			position: relative;
			}

			.hero-image-box img {
			width: 100%;
			height: 100%;
			object-fit: cover;
			display: block;
			}

			.hero-image-placeholder {
			padding: 25px;
			text-align: center;
			color: #9ba1aa;
			}

			.hero-image-placeholder strong {
			display: block;
			margin-bottom: 10px;
			font-size: 20px;
			color: #f2f2f2;
			}

			.hero-image-placeholder span {
			display: block;
			font-size: 14px;
			color: #7f8791;
			}

			/* =====================================================
			PROJECT SECTION
			===================================================== */
			#projects {
			padding: 90px 0 120px;
			}

			.section-intro-box {
			padding: 30px;
			margin-bottom: 35px;
			}

			.section-label {
			margin-bottom: 10px;
			color: #858c96;
			font-size: 12px;
			font-weight: bold;
			letter-spacing: 4px;
			}

			.section-title {
			margin-bottom: 15px;
			font-size: clamp(38px, 6vw, 55px);
			}

			.section-description {
			max-width: 700px;
			color: #9fa5ae;
			}

			/* =====================================================
			PROJECT CARDS
			===================================================== */
			.project-grid {
			display: grid;
			grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
			gap: 22px;
			margin-bottom: 35px;
			}

			.project-card {
			display: flex;
			flex-direction: column;
			min-height: 320px;
			background: rgba(18, 21, 26, 0.92);
			border: 1px solid #2b3038;
			border-radius: 8px;
			overflow: hidden;
			transition: border-color 0.2s, transform 0.2s;
			}

			.project-card:hover {
			border-color: #525a66;
			transform: translateY(-3px);
			}

			.project-card.active {
			border-color: #89919d;
			}

			.project-main {
			flex: 1;
			padding: 25px;
			}

			.project-engine {
			margin-bottom: 8px;
			color: #7f8791;
			font-size: 11px;
			font-weight: bold;
			letter-spacing: 2px;
			}

			.project-main h3 {
			margin-bottom: 7px;
			font-size: 26px;
			}

			.project-tech {
			margin-bottom: 15px;
			color: #828994;
			font-size: 13px;
			}

			.project-description {
			color: #b5bac1;
			font-size: 15px;
			}

			.view-project {
			width: 100%;
			padding: 16px 22px;
			border: none;
			border-top: 1px solid #2b3038;
			background: #13161b;
			color: #eeeeee;
			cursor: pointer;
			text-align: left;
			font-weight: bold;
			}

			.view-project::after {
			content: "→";
			float: right;
			color: #828994;
			}

			.view-project:hover {
			background: #1a1e24;
			}

			.project-card.active .view-project {
			background: #1c2026;
			}

			/* =====================================================
			SHARED PROJECT AREA
			===================================================== */
			.project-showcase {
			width: 100%;
			min-height: 500px;
			background: rgba(13, 16, 20, 0.92);
			border: 1px solid #2b3038;
			border-radius: 8px;
			overflow: hidden;
			box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.25);
			}

			.project-detail {
			display: none;
			padding: 45px;
			}

			.project-detail.active {
			display: block;
			}

			/* =====================================================
			PROJECT HEADER
			===================================================== */
			.detail-top {
			margin-bottom: 45px;
			}

			.detail-engine {
			margin-bottom: 8px;
			color: #858c96;
			font-size: 12px;
			font-weight: bold;
			letter-spacing: 3px;
			}

			.detail-top h2 {
			margin-bottom: 12px;
			font-size: clamp(36px, 6vw, 55px);
			}

			.detail-top p {
			max-width: 850px;
			color: #aeb4bc;
			}

			/* =====================================================
			PROJECT SECTIONS
			===================================================== */
			.detail-section {
			margin-top: 50px;
			}

			.detail-section h3 {
			margin-bottom: 18px;
			font-size: 26px;
			}

			.detail-section > p {
			max-width: 850px;
			color: #aeb4bc;
			}

			.detail-list {
			display: grid;
			gap: 10px;
			color: #b6bcc4;
			}

			.detail-list li {
			margin-left: 4px;
			}

			/* =====================================================
			DEVELOPMENT / QA
			===================================================== */
			.work-grid {
			display: grid;
			grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
			gap: 18px;
			}

			.work-box {
			padding: 22px;
			background: rgba(21, 24, 29, 0.90);
			border: 1px solid #2c3139;
			border-radius: 6px;
			}

			.work-box h4 {
			margin-bottom: 10px;
			font-size: 19px;
			}

			.work-box p,
			.work-box li {
			color: #a5abb3;
			font-size: 15px;
			}

			/* =====================================================
			TOOLS
			===================================================== */
			.tags {
			display: flex;
			flex-wrap: wrap;
			gap: 9px;
			}

			.tags span {
			padding: 7px 11px;
			background: #171a20;
			border: 1px solid #30353d;
			border-radius: 4px;
			color: #b9bec5;
			font-size: 13px;
			}

			/* =====================================================
			VIDEO / IMAGES
			===================================================== */
			.media-layout {
			display: grid;
			grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr;
			gap: 18px;
			}

			.video-box {
			min-height: 360px;
			display: flex;
			align-items: center;
			justify-content: center;
			background: #101318;
			border: 1px solid #30353d;
			border-radius: 6px;
			color: #666d76;
			text-align: center;
			overflow: hidden;
			padding: 20px;
			}

			.image-column {
			display: grid;
			grid-template-rows: 1fr 1fr;
			gap: 18px;
			}

			.image-box {
			min-height: 170px;
			display: flex;
			align-items: center;
			justify-content: center;
			background: #15181d;
			border: 1px solid #30353d;
			border-radius: 6px;
			color: #666d76;
			text-align: center;
			overflow: hidden;
			padding: 18px;
			}

			.image-box img,
			.video-box video {
			width: 100%;
			height: 100%;
			display: block;
			object-fit: cover;
			}

			/* =====================================================
			CODE
			===================================================== */
			.code-box {
			overflow-x: auto;
			background: #07090c;
			border: 1px solid #30353d;
			border-radius: 6px;
			}

			.code-title {
			padding: 11px 15px;
			background: #171a20;
			border-bottom: 1px solid #30353d;
			color: #9097a1;
			font-size: 13px;
			}

			pre {
			margin: 0;
			padding: 22px;
			color: #d4d8dd;
			white-space: pre-wrap;
			}

			code {
			font-family: Consolas, "Courier New", monospace;
			font-size: 14px;
			}

			/* =====================================================
			FOOTER
			===================================================== */
			footer {
			padding: 35px 20px;
			text-align: center;
			color: #666d76;
			background: rgba(8, 10, 13, 0.90);
			border-top: 1px solid #24282f;
			}

			/* =====================================================
			MOBILE
			===================================================== */
			@media (max-width: 950px) {
			.hero-layout {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
			}

			.hero-image-box {
			min-height: 320px;
			}

			.project-grid {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
			}

			.work-grid {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
			}

			.media-layout {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
			}

			.image-column {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
			grid-template-rows: auto;
			}
			}

			@media (max-width: 600px) {
			.nav-links {
			display: none;
			}

			.hero h1 {
			font-size: 55px;
			letter-spacing: -2px;
			}

			.hero-content-box {
			padding: 25px;
			}

			.hero-buttons {
			flex-direction: column;
			align-items: flex-start;
			}

			.section-intro-box {
			padding: 25px;
			}

			.project-detail {
			padding: 25px;
			}

			.image-column {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
			}
			}
		</style>
	</head>

	<body>

		<!-- MATRIX BACKGROUND -->
		<canvas
			id="matrix-bg"
			aria-hidden="true"
    ></canvas>

		<!-- NAVIGATION -->
		<header>
			<nav>
				<a
					href="#home"
					class="logo"
            >
					Josh Maddox
				</a>

				<div class="nav-links">
					<a href="#home">Home</a>
					<a href="#projects">Projects</a>
				</div>
			</nav>
		</header>

		<main>

			<!-- HOME -->
			<section
				id="home"
				class="hero"
        >
				<div class="content-box hero-content-box">
					<div class="hero-layout">

						<div class="hero-left">
							<p class="hero-label">
								GAME PROGRAMMER • QA ENGINEER
							</p>

							<h1>Josh Maddox</h1>

							<h2>Game Programmer | QA Engineer</h2>

							<p class="hero-description">
								Game Development graduate focused on game programming,
								quality assurance, testing, debugging, and technical
								problem solving. Experienced with Unreal Engine, C++,
								Unity, C#, Godot, and collaborative game development.
							</p>

							<div class="hero-buttons">
								<a
									href="#projects"
									class="button primary-button"
                            >
									View Projects
								</a>

								<a
									href="https://github.com/Josh-Maddox"
									target="_blank"
									rel="noopener noreferrer"
									class="button secondary-button"
                            >
									GitHub
								</a>
							</div>
						</div>

						<div class="hero-right">
							<div class="hero-image-box">

								<!-- PUT YOUR IMAGE HERE -->
								<!-- Replace the placeholder below with your image -->
								<!-- Example:
                            <img src="/images/josh.jpg" alt="Josh Maddox" />
                            -->

								<div class="hero-image-placeholder">
									<strong>Your Photo Here</strong>
									Add your image later by replacing this box with:
									<span>&lt;img src="/images/josh.jpg" alt="Josh Maddox" /&gt;</span>
								</div>

							</div>
						</div>

					</div>
				</div>
			</section>

			<!-- PROJECTS -->
			<section id="projects">
				<div class="content-box section-intro-box">
					<p class="section-label">SELECTED WORK</p>

					<h2 class="section-title">Featured Projects</h2>

					<p class="section-description">
						Projects demonstrating programming, game development,
						testing, debugging, technical problem solving, and
						collaborative development experience.
					</p>
				</div>

				<!-- PROJECT CARDS -->
				<div class="project-grid">

					<!-- ASHEN BLOOM -->
					<article
						class="project-card active"
						data-project="ashen"
                >
						<div class="project-main">
							<p class="project-engine">UNREAL ENGINE 5.6</p>

							<h3>Ashen Bloom</h3>

							<p class="project-tech">C++ • Blueprints • PCG</p>

							<p class="project-description">
								A third-person character-action souls-lite in a dying world
								where nature has fused with machines, corpses, and ruined cities.
							</p>
						</div>

						<button
							type="button"
							class="view-project"
							data-target="ashen"
                    >
							View Project
						</button>
					</article>

					<!-- ROBORUN -->
					<article
						class="project-card"
						data-project="roborun"
                >
						<div class="project-main">
							<p class="project-engine">UNITY</p>

							<h3>RoboRun</h3>

							<p class="project-tech">Unity • C#</p>

							<p class="project-description">
								A Unity project featuring gameplay systems, upgrades,
								a shop, overworld development, and level / map creation.
							</p>
						</div>

						<button
							type="button"
							class="view-project"
							data-target="roborun"
                    >
							View Project
						</button>
					</article>

					<!-- I AM THE WALL -->
					<article
						class="project-card"
						data-project="wall"
                >
						<div class="project-main">
							<p class="project-engine">GODOT GAME JAM</p>

							<h3>I Am the Wall</h3>

							<p class="project-tech">Godot • Pixel Art • Animation</p>

							<p class="project-description">
								A game jam project where I contributed most of the pixel art,
								animation, color palette work, and game design support.
							</p>
						</div>

						<button
							type="button"
							class="view-project"
							data-target="wall"
                    >
							View Project
						</button>
					</article>
				</div>

				<!-- SHARED PROJECT DISPLAY -->
				<div class="project-showcase">

					<!-- ASHEN BLOOM -->
					<div
						id="ashen"
						class="project-detail active"
                >
						<div class="detail-top">
							<p class="detail-engine">UNREAL ENGINE 5.6</p>
							<h2>Ashen Bloom</h2>
							<p>
								Ashen Bloom is a singleplayer third-person
								character-action souls-lite set in a dying world
								where nature has fused with machines, corpses, and ruined cities.
								This project was developed collaboratively in Unreal Engine 5.6.
							</p>
						</div>

						<div class="detail-section">
							<h3>Project Overview</h3>
							<p>
								Ashen Bloom combines action combat, exploration,
								environmental storytelling, and stylized dark fantasy /
								sci-fi worldbuilding. The project included gameplay systems,
								UI, progression, environment work, and technical world building.
							</p>
						</div>

						<div class="detail-section">
							<h3>My Contributions</h3>
							<ul class="detail-list">
								<li>Implemented the Inventory system.</li>
								<li>Built the Level-up system.</li>
								<li>Created the inventory character rotation view.</li>
								<li>Built the Forest PCG system.</li>
								<li>Set up landscape grass using LTG_Grass.</li>
								<li>Authored the landscape texture layering system.</li>
								<li>Worked collaboratively with the team inside Unreal Engine 5.6.</li>
							</ul>
						</div>

						<div class="detail-section">
							<h3>Development & QA</h3>
							<div class="work-grid">
								<div class="work-box">
									<h4>Programming / Development</h4>
									<ul class="detail-list">
										<li>Gameplay support systems in Unreal Engine 5.6.</li>
										<li>Inventory and player progression features.</li>
										<li>Environment support through procedural forest setup.</li>
										<li>Landscape grass and material layer setup.</li>
										<li>Technical implementation using C++ and Blueprints.</li>
									</ul>
								</div>

								<div class="work-box">
									<h4>Testing / Debugging</h4>
									<ul class="detail-list">
										<li>Tested systems after implementation and iteration.</li>
										<li>Helped identify bugs and technical issues during development.</li>
										<li>Checked functionality after changes to UI, systems, and environment work.</li>
										<li>Used troubleshooting and iteration to improve stability and usability.</li>
									</ul>
								</div>
							</div>
						</div>

						<div class="detail-section">
							<h3>Tools & Technologies</h3>
							<div class="tags">
								<span>Unreal Engine 5.6</span>
								<span>C++</span>
								<span>Blueprints</span>
								<span>PCG</span>
								<span>Gaea 2</span>
								<span>Blender</span>
								<span>Perforce</span>
								<span>Visual Studio</span>
							</div>
						</div>

						<div class="detail-section">
							<h3>Gameplay & Media</h3>
							<div class="media-layout">
								<div class="video-box">
									Add Ashen Bloom gameplay video here
								</div>

								<div class="image-column">
									<div class="image-box">
										Add forest / environment screenshot here
									</div>

									<div class="image-box">
										Add inventory / UI screenshot here
									</div>
								</div>
							</div>
						</div>

						<div class="detail-section">
							<h3>Code Example</h3>
							<div class="code-box">
								<div class="code-title">Ashen Bloom • C++ / Unreal</div>
								<pre>
									<code>
										// Example section for Ashen Bloom
										// Good places to show later:
										//
										// - Inventory system code
										// - Level-up / progression code
